sf-tree-ins : Word → List Word → List Word → List Word → SfTree → SfTree
sf-tree-ins hk k wit v sfLeaf = sfNode hk k wit (cons v nil) sfLeaf sfLeaf
sf-tree-ins hk k wit v (sfNode hk0 k0 w0 vs l r) =
  if wlt hk hk0 then sfNode hk0 k0 w0 vs (sf-tree-ins hk k wit v l) r
  else if wlt hk0 hk then sfNode hk0 k0 w0 vs l (sf-tree-ins hk k wit v r)
  else if h-eq k k0 then sfNode hk0 k0 w0 (if sf-in-list v vs then vs else cons v vs) l r
  else sfNode hk0 k0 w0 vs l (sf-tree-ins hk k wit v r)
